<div class="email-container">
    <!-- Email Headers -->
    <div class="email-headers">
        <div class="header-line">
            <span class="header-label">From:</span> 
            <a href="http://adam47.com">Adam Cornelius</a> &lt;<a href="mailto:adamecornelius@gmail.com">adamecornelius@gmail.com</a>&gt;
        </div>
        <div class="header-line">
            <span class="header-label">To:</span> 
            Friends and Family
        </div>
        <div class="header-line">
            <span class="header-label">Subject:</span> <strong>A Personal Note Regarding Holly and Me</strong>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Email Body -->
    <div class="email-body">
        <p>Friends and family,</p>

        <p>There are seasons in a life—and in a marriage—that test the architecture of what two people have built together. Holly and I are in one of those seasons now, and we are entering a legal separation.</p>

        <p>The language of a legal process is necessarily formal, even when the feelings behind it remain deeply human. I still love my wife very much. Because this is a difficult passage, I hope you will reach out to her and offer the quiet steadiness of your friendship and support. For my part, out of respect for the process and the boundaries it requires, I will not be returning or contacting her while we work through these matters in the San Mateo County Superior Court System, Southern District.</p>

        <p>Our civic institutions do much of their most important work in the open. Our next hearing on <strong>December 3rd</strong> is a public proceeding, and for those who wish to observe the process or simply be present, I encourage you to attend.</p>

        <div class="info-block">
            <strong>Public Hearing Information</strong><br>
            <strong>Date:</strong> December 3rd<br>
            <strong>Court:</strong> San Mateo County Superior Court, Southern District<br>
            <strong>Access &amp; Schedule:</strong> <a href="[INSERT_COURT_LINK_HERE]">View Court Hearing Details &amp; Attend ([INSERT_TIME_HERE])</a>
        </div>

        <p>Thank you for your grace, your patience, and the care you continue to extend to our family.</p>

        <p>With gratitude,</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Email Signature -->
    <div class="signature">
        <strong><a href="http://adam47.com">Adam Cornelius</a></strong><br>
        <a href="mailto:adamecornelius@gmail.com">adamecornelius@gmail.com</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Legal Disclaimers -->
    <div class="legal-disclaimer">
        <p><strong>Notice &amp; Compliance Disclaimer:</strong> This communication is intended to conform with all applicable provisions of the California Family Code, the California Rules of Court, and all active orders of the Superior Court of California, County of San Mateo. It is shared solely as a general personal update to friends and family regarding a matter of public record.</p>
        <p><strong>No Indirect Contact:</strong> Nothing in this message is intended to constitute, nor should it be construed as, direct or indirect communication with any opposing or protected party. Recipients are respectfully asked not to forward this message or relay any communications on the sender's behalf. All formal or legal correspondence regarding this matter is handled exclusively through appropriate court channels and counsel of record.</p>
        <p><strong>Public Access &amp; Informational Notice:</strong> Reference to the December 3rd hearing reflects general public access to court proceedings under California law (Cal. Code Civ. Proc. &sect; 124) and remains subject to local courtroom rules, scheduling changes, or any confidentiality or closure orders issued by the presiding judicial officer. This message is for informational purposes only and does not constitute legal advice.</p>
    </div>
